See .cursor/rules/ for the structured rule files. The most important ones:
- comments.mdc:when (and when not) to write comments
- monorepo-conventions.mdc:workspace, scripts, releases
- plugin-shape.mdc:how every plugin in packages/ is structured

This repo uses pnpm 10, Turborepo, Biome 2.4, tsdown, vitest, changesets, and fumadocs.
Always run via pnpm. Never npm or yarn.
